window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I chased after a monster, and now I’m not sure I’ll survive his wrath. Gavril Nitkin is renowned for his dark and depraved ways.</p> <p>After years of crushing on the hot, sadistic, and intimidating professor, I finally try to reel him in.</p> <p>Big mistake.</p> <p>The man isn’t human, he’s a beast.</p> <p>And now I’ve got his attention, he won’t leave me alone.</p> <p>He’s mean, tortured, wicked, and possibly insane.</p> <p>There’s a change in the way he looks at me.</p> <p>He looks at me with a simmering inferno burning in those unique hazel eyes.</p> <p>Misbehaving is the best way to get close to Professor Nitkin.</p> <p>My countless appearances at his door open my eyes to some rather twisted facts about myself.</p> <p>I know I should quit him before I end up broken beyond repair.</p> <p>The problem is, once I’m hooked on him, I can’t quit.</p> <p>I fear he’s already too deep under my skin.</p> <p>As graduation approaches, the more important question isn’t whether I’ll survive his wrath, but whether I’ll survive the heartache of having to walk away.</p> <p>As a monster can't have a heart to give, but I can’t help but hope that this monster isn’t beyond repair.</p> <p>Sinful Lessons is the third book in the Syndicate Academy Series. This book can be listened to as a standalone and has a happily ever after ending. This is a dark forbidden student/teacher romance story and has dark themes, hot scenes, violence, content some listeners may find upsetting, and bad language.</p>"; 
